{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"Basilisk.Basilisk","latestVersion":"52.9.2026.11.01","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.df23826d.png","priority":1,"sha256":"df23826df860a74c37b5c652942d13ac973681433d388fd268706376011bc501","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A XUL-based web-browser built on top of the Unified XUL Platform (UXP). This browser is a close twin to pre-Servo Firefox in how it operates.","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A XUL-based web-browser built on top of the Unified XUL Platform (UXP). This browser is a close twin to pre-Servo Firefox in how it operates.","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Basilisk is a free and Open Source XUL-based web browser, featuring the well-known Firefox-style interface and operation. It is based on the Goanna layout and rendering engine (a fork of Gecko) and builds on the Unified XUL Platform (UXP), which in turn is a fork of the Mozilla code base without Servo or Rust.","name":"Basilisk","packageUrl":"https://www.basilisk-browser.org/download.html","publisher":"Basilisk Development Team","publisherUrl":"https://www.basilisk-browser.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.basilisk-browser.org/releasenotes.html","tags":["browser","internet","web","web-browser","webpage","xul"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"建立在统一 XUL 平台（UXP）之上的基于 XUL 的网络浏览器。该浏览器的运行方式与 Servo 前一世代的火狐浏览器十分相似。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Basilisk 是一款基于 XUL 的免费开源网络浏览器，具有著名的 Firefox 风格界面和操作方式。它基于 Goanna 布局和渲染引擎（Gecko 的分叉），建立在统一 XUL 平台 (UXP) 上，而 UXP 又是 Mozilla 代码库的分叉，没有 Servo 或 Rust。","tags":["xul","浏览器","火狐","火狐浏览器","网页","网页浏览器"]}},"longDescription":"Basilisk is a free and Open Source XUL-based web browser, featuring the well-known Firefox-style interface and operation. It is based on the Goanna layout and rendering engine (a fork of Gecko) an